@SmartHomeApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@sensorId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Health check
GET {{SmartHomeApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{SmartHomeApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Devices

### Get all devices
GET {{SmartHomeApi_HostAddress}}/api/devices
Accept: application/json

### Get device by ID
GET {{SmartHomeApi_HostAddress}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Sensors

### Get all sensors
GET {{SmartHomeApi_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Accept: application/json

### Get sensor by ID
GET {{SmartHomeApi_HostAddress}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}
Accept: application/json
